<title>PHILIPPINES: New ABS-CBN,Kuok shares approved.</title>
<headline>New ABS-CBN,Kuok shares approved.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Stock Exchange said on Monday it had approved the listing of 259,861,104 additional common shares of ABS-CBN Broadcasting Corp with a par value of one peso per share.</p>
<p>The exchange also approved the listing of 262,807,366 additional common shares of Kuok Philippine Properties Inc at one peso per share.</p>
<p>The ABS-CBN listing will cover the firm's 50 percent stock dividend declaration for stockholders of record as of May 23, while the Kuok listing will cover the private placement of Pecanola Company Ltd.</p>
<p>Listing of the shares of both companies is scheduled on September 30.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 632 8418938 fax 8176267</p>
